{
  "id": "dmwaa71kxrt1z",
  "name": "聚光引导",
  "tags": [
    "提示",
    "动画"
  ],
  "summary": "新手引导时把页面压暗，用聚光灯在目标元素上挖一个洞、旁边浮出说明气泡（标题 + 一句话 + 上一步/下一步/跳过），点下一步聚光平滑移到下一个目标。",
  "usage": "首次进入的功能引导：3–5 个关键入口逐个介绍，用户可跳过；桌面端和移动端都能用。",
  "caution": "别超过 5 步；目标元素必须在视口内；引导期间页面不可交互，会打断任务，高频操作里别弹，常规提示改用 Toast。",
  "hint": "点「下一步」聚光移到下一个目标；点「跳过」或 Esc 关闭",
  "prompt": "【聚光引导】目标：新手引导时把页面压暗，在目标元素上开一圈聚光灯洞，旁边浮出说明气泡；点「下一步」聚光平滑移到下一个目标，点「跳过」/Esc 结束。\n\n1) 结构：.page（被引导页面：顶栏 + 标题行 + 列表）；.spot（position:fixed，无背景，用 box-shadow:0 0 0 9999px 半透明黑向四周扩散当遮罩、中间透明露出目标，outline 2px 主色做高亮环）；.tip（fixed 气泡：标题 + 步骤数 + 一句话 + 跳过/上一步/下一步）。\n2) 定位：spot 用目标 getBoundingClientRect() 外扩 5px 兜住目标；气泡默认放目标下方 12px，下方放不下就翻到上方，水平居中后夹到 [8, 视口宽-8-气泡宽]；读到的 rect 宽高为 0 时直接 return。\n3) 动画：spot 的 left/top/width/height 用 0.42 秒 cubic-bezier(.3,.9,.3,1) 过渡，聚光像探照灯一样滑到下一个目标；气泡 left/top 0.35 秒同曲线，透明度 0.2 秒。\n4) 交互：下一步/上一步切换，最后一步按钮文字变「完成」并关闭；跳过随时关闭；Esc 关闭；关闭后页面右下出现「重新引导」按钮。\n5) 无障碍：气泡 role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-label；打开时 focus 到「下一步」按钮，必须写 focus({preventScroll:true})——裸 focus 会把父页面滚到这张卡片；关闭后还焦点给触发按钮（同样带 preventScroll）。\n6) 坑：遮罩用 #000 半透明（聚光灯必须压暗，不能跟 --ui-bg 走，否则浅色主题遮罩会变白、深色主题会变亮）；spot 必须 pointer-events:none，否则会挡住目标；不要用 clip-path 挖洞（和圆角/描边组合容易出错），box-shadow 扩散最稳；卡片只有 176px 高，气泡要能自动翻到上方。\n7) 配色：页面/气泡/按钮全用 --ui-* 变量；只有遮罩的黑色是写死的 color-mix(in srgb,#000 58%,transparent)，因为聚光灯就是压暗背景。\n8) 自动演示：包在 if(!window.__uiInteractive) 里循环：光标点「下一步」→ 聚光移动 → 再点 → 最后一步点「完成」→ 关闭 → 重新开始；弹窗里只绑真实交互，初始打开第 1 步。\n9) 与普通弹窗/遮罩的区别：普通弹窗是打断并要用户回应；聚光引导是在真实页面上指路，聚光必须落在真实元素上，遮罩只是变暗背景。\n10) 使用场景：首次进入的功能引导 3–5 步、可跳过；别超过 5 步，目标元素必须在视口内，高频操作场景别弹。",
  "demoHtml": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nhtml,body{height:100%}\nbody{margin:0;overflow:hidden;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",system-ui,\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;color:var(--ui-text);background:var(--ui-bg)}\n\n/* ---------- 被引导的页面 ---------- */\n.page{position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px;padding:14px 16px}\n.pbar{flex:0 0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;min-width:0}\n.logo{width:16px;height:16px;flex:0 0 auto;border-radius:5px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 72%,#fff),var(--ui-brand))}\n.pbar b{font-size:12px;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap}\n.search{flex:1;min-width:0;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;border:1px solid var(--ui-border);background:var(--ui-surface);border-radius:7px;padding:5px 8px;font-size:10px;color:var(--ui-text-dim);white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}\n.search .mag{font-size:10px;flex:0 0 auto}\n.notice{flex:0 0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;border:1px solid var(--ui-border);background:var(--ui-surface);border-radius:7px;padding:5px 8px;font-size:10px;color:var(--ui-text-dim);white-space:nowrap}\n.badge{width:6px;height:6px;flex:0 0 auto;border-radius:50%;background:var(--ui-danger)}\n.pbody{flex:1;min-height:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}\n.phead{flex:0 0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:1px 1px 2px}\n.phead b{font-size:11px;font-weight:600}\n.create{margin-left:auto;border:0;border-radius:7px;padding:5px 10px;font:inherit;font-size:9px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ui-bg);background:var(--ui-brand);cursor:pointer;transition:transform .12s ease}\n.plist{flex:1;min-height:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;overflow:hidden}\n.prow{flex:0 0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:7px 9px;border:1px solid var(--ui-border);background:var(--ui-surface);border-radius:9px;min-width:0}\n.pdot{width:16px;height:16px;flex:0 0 auto;border-radius:5px;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 16%,transparent)}\n.plines{flex:1;min-width:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px}\n.plines b{height:6px;width:54%;border-radius:3px;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 12%,transparent)}\n.plines span{height:5px;width:78%;border-radius:3px;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 7%,transparent)}\n.ptag{flex:0 0 auto;font-size:8px;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--ui-surface-2);color:var(--ui-text-dim);white-space:nowrap}\n.reopen{position:absolute;right:16px;bottom:12px;border:1px solid var(--ui-border);background:var(--ui-surface);color:var(--ui-text-dim);font:inherit;font-size:9px;padding:4px 9px;border-radius:7px;cursor:pointer}\n\n/* ---------- 聚光灯：box-shadow 向四周扩散当遮罩，中间留洞 ---------- */\n.spot{position:fixed;left:0;top:0;width:0;height:0;z-index:10;pointer-events:none;border-radius:10px;\n  outline:2px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 62%,transparent);outline-offset:1px;\n  box-shadow:0 0 0 9999px color-mix(in srgb,#000 58%,transparent);\n  transition:left .42s cubic-bezier(.3,.9,.3,1),top .42s cubic-bezier(.3,.9,.3,1),width .42s cubic-bezier(.3,.9,.3,1),height .42s cubic-bezier(.3,.9,.3,1),opacity .24s ease}\n.spot.off{opacity:0}\n\n/* ---------- 说明气泡 ---------- */\n.tip{position:fixed;left:0;top:0;z-index:20;width:206px;padding:10px 11px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--ui-surface);border:1px solid var(--ui-border);box-shadow:0 16px 40px color-mix(in srgb,#000 30%,transparent);opacity:0;transform:translateY(4px);pointer-events:none;transition:left .35s cubic-bezier(.3,.9,.3,1),top .35s cubic-bezier(.3,.9,.3,1),opacity .2s ease,transform .2s ease}\n.tip.show{opacity:1;transform:none;pointer-events:auto}\n.tip-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin-bottom:5px}\n.tip-head b{font-size:11px;font-weight:600}\n.tip-head span{margin-left:auto;font-size:9px;color:var(--ui-text-dim);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;white-space:nowrap}\n.tip p{margin:0 0 9px;font-size:10px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--ui-text-dim)}\n.tip-actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n.skip{border:0;background:transparent;color:var(--ui-text-dim);font:inherit;font-size:9px;padding:4px 2px;cursor:pointer;transition:transform .12s ease,color .15s ease}\n.skip:hover{color:var(--ui-text)}\n.nav{margin-left:auto;display:flex;gap:5px}\n.ghost{border:1px solid var(--ui-border);background:transparent;color:var(--ui-text-dim);font:inherit;font-size:9px;padding:4px 8px;border-radius:6px;cursor:pointer;transition:transform .12s ease,color .15s ease}\n.ghost:hover{color:var(--ui-text)}\n.next{border:0;background:var(--ui-brand);color:var(--ui-bg);font:inherit;font-size:9px;font-weight:600;padding:4px 9px;border-radius:6px;cursor:pointer;transition:transform .12s ease,filter .15s ease}\n.next:hover{filter:brightness(1.08)}\n.next.pressing,.skip.pressing,.ghost.pressing{transform:scale(.94)}\n\n@media (max-height:420px){\n  .page{padding:10px 12px;gap:7px}\n  .pbar b{font-size:11px}\n  .search{padding:4px 7px;font-size:9px}\n  .notice{padding:4px 7px;font-size:9px}\n  .phead b{font-size:10px}\n  .create{font-size:8px;padding:4px 8px}\n  .plist{gap:5px}\n  .prow{padding:5px 7px;gap:6px;border-radius:7px}\n  .pdot{width:13px;height:13px;border-radius:4px}\n  .ptag{font-size:7px;padding:1px 5px}\n  .tip{width:178px;padding:8px 9px}\n  .tip-head b{font-size:10px}\n  .tip p{font-size:9px;line-height:1.5;margin-bottom:7px}\n  .tip-actions{gap:5px}\n  .next,.ghost,.skip{font-size:8px;padding:3px 7px}\n  .reopen{right:12px;bottom:8px;font-size:8px;padding:3px 7px}\n}\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){\n  .spot,.tip,.next,.skip,.ghost{transition:none}\n}\n</style></head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"pbar\">\n    <i class=\"logo\"></i><b>工作台</b>\n    <div class=\"search\" id=\"targetSearch\"><span class=\"mag\">⌕</span>搜索项目…</div>\n    <div class=\"notice\" id=\"targetNotice\"><i class=\"badge\"></i>通知</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"pbody\">\n    <div class=\"phead\">\n      <b>我的项目</b>\n      <button class=\"create\" id=\"targetCreate\" type=\"button\">新建项目</button>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"plist\">\n      <div class=\"prow\"><i class=\"pdot\"></i><div class=\"plines\"><b></b><span></span></div><span class=\"ptag\">进行中</span></div>\n      <div class=\"prow\"><i class=\"pdot\"></i><div class=\"plines\"><b></b><span></span></div><span class=\"ptag\">已完成</span></div>\n      <div class=\"prow\"><i class=\"pdot\"></i><div class=\"plines\"><b></b><span></span></div><span class=\"ptag\">进行中</span></div>\n      <div class=\"prow\"><i class=\"pdot\"></i><div class=\"plines\"><b></b><span></span></div><span class=\"ptag\">草稿</span></div>\n      <div class=\"prow\"><i class=\"pdot\"></i><div class=\"plines\"><b></b><span></span></div><span class=\"ptag\">草稿</span></div>\n      <div class=\"prow\"><i class=\"pdot\"></i><div class=\"plines\"><b></b><span></span></div><span class=\"ptag\">已完成</span></div>\n      <div class=\"prow\"><i class=\"pdot\"></i><div class=\"plines\"><b></b><span></span></div><span class=\"ptag\">进行中</span></div>\n      <div class=\"prow\"><i class=\"pdot\"></i><div class=\"plines\"><b></b><span></span></div><span class=\"ptag\">草稿</span></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <button class=\"reopen\" id=\"reopenBtn\" type=\"button\" style=\"display:none\">重新引导</button>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"spot off\" id=\"spot\"></div>\n\n<div class=\"tip\" id=\"tip\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-label=\"新手引导\">\n  <div class=\"tip-head\"><b id=\"tipTitle\">搜索项目</b><span id=\"tipStep\">1 / 3</span></div>\n  <p id=\"tipDesc\">在顶部搜索框里找项目、文档和操作</p>\n  <div class=\"tip-actions\">\n    <button class=\"skip\" id=\"skipBtn\" type=\"button\">跳过</button>\n    <div class=\"nav\">\n      <button class=\"ghost\" id=\"prevBtn\" type=\"button\">上一步</button>\n      <button class=\"next\" id=\"nextBtn\" type=\"button\">下一步</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var spot = document.getElementById('spot'),\n      tip = document.getElementById('tip'),\n      tipTitle = document.getElementById('tipTitle'),\n      tipDesc = document.getElementById('tipDesc'),\n      tipStep = document.getElementById('tipStep'),\n      prevBtn = document.getElementById('prevBtn'),\n      nextBtn = document.getElementById('nextBtn'),\n      skipBtn = document.getElementById('skipBtn'),\n      reopenBtn = document.getElementById('reopenBtn');\n\n  var targets = [\n    { el: document.getElementById('targetSearch'), title: '搜索项目', desc: '在顶部搜索框里找项目、文档和操作' },\n    { el: document.getElementById('targetNotice'), title: '消息通知', desc: '新评论和任务提醒都会出现在这里' },\n    { el: document.getElementById('targetCreate'), title: '新建项目', desc: '点这里创建第一个项目，随时可以跳过引导' }\n  ];\n\n  var idx = 0, isOpen = false, timers = [], cursor = null, cursorReady = false, lastTrigger = null;\n\n  function later(fn, ms){ timers.push(setTimeout(fn, ms)); }\n  function clearTimers(){ for(var i = 0; i < timers.length; i++) clearTimeout(timers[i]); timers = []; }\n  function ensureCursor(){\n    if(cursorReady) return cursor;\n    cursorReady = true;\n    if(!window.__uiInteractive && typeof window.__uiDemoCursor === 'function'){\n      cursor = window.__uiDemoCursor();\n      setTimeout(function(){ if(cursor && typeof cursor.hide === 'function') cursor.hide(); }, 120);\n    }\n    return cursor;\n  }\n  function showCursor(){ if(cursor && cursor.el) cursor.el.classList.add('show'); }\n\n  function place(i){\n    var target = targets[i].el;\n    var r = target.getBoundingClientRect();\n    if(!r.width && !r.height) return;\n    var pad = 5;\n    spot.style.left = (r.left - pad) + 'px';\n    spot.style.top = (r.top - pad) + 'px';\n    spot.style.width = (r.width + pad * 2) + 'px';\n    spot.style.height = (r.height + pad * 2) + 'px';\n\n    var W = window.innerWidth, H = window.innerHeight;\n    var tw = tip.offsetWidth || 206, th = tip.offsetHeight || 92;\n    var top = r.bottom + 12;\n    if(top + th > H - 8) top = r.top - 12 - th;\n    if(top < 8) top = 8;\n    var left = r.left + r.width / 2 - tw / 2;\n    left = Math.max(8, Math.min(W - 8 - tw, left));\n    tip.style.left = left + 'px';\n    tip.style.top = top + 'px';\n  }\n\n  function paint(i){\n    idx = i;\n    tipTitle.textContent = targets[i].title;\n    tipDesc.textContent = targets[i].desc;\n    tipStep.textContent = (i + 1) + ' / ' + targets.length;\n    prevBtn.style.visibility = i === 0 ? 'hidden' : 'visible';\n    nextBtn.textContent = i === targets.length - 1 ? '完成' : '下一步';\n    place(i);\n    if(window.__uiInteractive) nextBtn.focus({ preventScroll: true });\n  }\n\n  function open(i){\n    isOpen = true;\n    spot.classList.remove('off');\n    tip.classList.add('show');\n    reopenBtn.style.display = 'none';\n    paint(i);\n  }\n  function close(){\n    if(!isOpen) return;\n    isOpen = false;\n    spot.classList.add('off');\n    tip.classList.remove('show');\n    reopenBtn.style.display = '';\n    if(window.__uiInteractive && lastTrigger) lastTrigger.focus({ preventScroll: true });\n  }\n  function nextStep(){\n    if(idx < targets.length - 1) paint(idx + 1);\n    else close();\n  }\n  function prevStep(){ if(idx > 0) paint(idx - 1); }\n\n  nextBtn.addEventListener('click', nextStep);\n  prevBtn.addEventListener('click', prevStep);\n  skipBtn.addEventListener('click', close);\n  reopenBtn.addEventListener('click', function(){ lastTrigger = reopenBtn; open(0); });\n  document.addEventListener('keydown', function(e){\n    if(!isOpen) return;\n    if(e.key === 'Escape'){ e.preventDefault(); close(); }\n  });\n\n  function tap(el, done){\n    if(!cursor){ done && done(); return; }\n    showCursor();\n    cursor.moveTo(el);\n    later(function(){\n      cursor.press();\n      el.classList.add('pressing');\n      later(function(){\n        cursor.release();\n        el.classList.remove('pressing');\n        done && done();\n      }, 190);\n    }, 560);\n  }\n\n  function demoCycle(){\n    clearTimers();\n    close();\n    ensureCursor();\n    if(cursor && typeof cursor.hide === 'function') cursor.hide();\n    if(!cursor){\n      later(function(){ open(0); }, 300);\n      later(close, 3400);\n      later(demoCycle, 4400);\n      return;\n    }\n    later(function(){ open(0); }, 250);\n    later(function(){ tap(nextBtn, nextStep); }, 1400);\n    later(function(){ tap(nextBtn, nextStep); }, 2600);\n    later(function(){ tap(nextBtn, nextStep); }, 3800);\n    later(function(){ close(); if(typeof cursor.hide === 'function') cursor.hide(); }, 5100);\n    later(demoCycle, 6300);\n  }\n\n  if(window.__uiInteractive){ open(0); }\n  else { setTimeout(demoCycle, 300); }\n})();\n</script>\n</body></html>",
